  "user_requirements": "The text may cover one working day or several. Return a list called entries with one entry for each day. Each entry has these fields, all optional (leave out what the text does not mention):\n- Project (Project or site name)\n- Author (Who wrote the diary, with their role)\n- Date (Date of the diary day)\n- Week number (Work week number, if mentioned)\n- Weather (Weather conditions: temperature, wind, rain or snow)\n- Personnel (People on site: supervisors, workers, subcontractors, total)\n- Work done (The day's work tasks, one entry for each)\n- Events (Notable events of the day)\n- Phases started (Work phases that were started)\n- Phases ongoing (Work phases that are in progress)\n- Phases completed (Work phases that were completed)\n- Phases interrupted (Work phases that were interrupted or paused)\n- Supervisor observations (The supervisor's observations and remarks)\n- Deviations (Deviations from the plan or the schedule)\n- Inspections (Inspections, surveys or visits made)\n- Safety (Safety observations, near misses or accidents)\n- Equipment (Machines and equipment used on site)\n- Deliveries (Material deliveries received)\n- Delays (Delays and what caused them)\n- Plans for the next day (What is planned for the next working day)\n- Attachments (Photos or documents attached to the diary)"
